        <p>This may include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your email address</li>
          <li>Any message you send us</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We may also collect basic non-personal information such as browser type, device information, and pages visited for website analytics purposes.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your messages or inquiries</li>
          <li>Improve our website and content</li>
          <li>Monitor website performance and usage</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our website may use cookies to improve user experience and analyze website traffic. You can disable cookies through your browser settings if you prefer.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We may use trusted third-party tools such as:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Google Analytics</li>
          <li>Web3Forms</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These services may collect limited technical information necessary for website functionality and analytics.</p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no internet transmission method is completely secure.</p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
